# Deliberately does NOT exclude node_modules: @azure/functions is marked
# --external in the esbuild build (it has an internal dynamic require on
# @azure/functions-core, which the Functions host resolves at runtime and
# which esbuild cannot bundle), so the real npm package must be present
# at deployment. Standard Azure Functions deployment runs npm install
# server-side (Oryx) or packages node_modules directly \u2014 either way,
# this file should only trim what's genuinely unneeded at runtime.
src/
*.ts
tsconfig.json
local.settings.json
local.settings.json.example
.git*
*.md
.vscode/
